OL,4,CMothballed Scottish spaceport helps    
OL,5,Cinspire new BBC sci-fi thriller        
OL,6,GA project to establish a spaceport in  
OL,7,Gthe Scottish Highlands has played a    
OL,8,Gpart in inspiring a new BBC sci-fi     
OL,9,Gthriller.                              
OL,11,FPlans to launch small satellites from  
OL,12,Fa facility near Tongue, in Sutherland, 
OL,13,Fwere unveiled in 2018, but the site    
OL,14,Fremains largely undeveloped after the  
OL,15,Foperator Orbex put construction on     
OL,16,Fhold before it later collapsed.        
OL,18,FThe new series, called Sutherland,     
OL,19,Fstars Gugu Mbatha-Raw and Stuart       
OL,20,FMartin and is set in the near future   
OL,21,Fin the area of the north Highlands it  
OL,22,Fis named after - as well as deep sG2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
