OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,C'No rescue required' as boat found     
OL,5,Cpartially sunk off Orkney              
OL,6,GHM Coastguard has confirmed a sighting 
OL,7,Gof a partially sunk boat off Orkney.   
OL,9,FThe wreck, which has not been formally 
OL,10,Fidentified, was reported at about      
OL,11,F10:30 and the coastguard sent an       
OL,12,Faircraft to inspect the site.          
OL,14,FA spokesperson said no further search  
OL,15,Fand rescue activity was required.      
OL,17,FIt comes a month after a fishing crew  
OL,18,Fand their vessel went missing north of 
OL,19,Fthe Isle of Lewis.                     
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
