OL,4,CBenedetti to stay on as Edinburgh      
OL,5,CInternational Festival director        
OL,6,GNicola Benedetti is to stay on as      
OL,7,Gdirector of the Edinburgh              
OL,8,GInternational Festival for a further   
OL,9,Gtwo years.                             
OL,11,FThe award-winning violinist was the    
OL,12,Ffirst Scot and the first woman to take 
OL,13,Fup the post when she was appointed in  
OL,14,F2022.                                  
OL,16,FFour years and four festivals later,   
OL,17,Fshe believes she needs more time to    
OL,18,Fcontinue the work she and her team     
OL,19,Fhave begun.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
